---
/* Big statement paragraph with scroll-scrubbed word reveal + footnotes. */
---

<section id="about" class="relative py-[18vh]">
  <div class="grid-site gap-y-10">
    <p class="label col-span-6 md:col-span-2" data-reveal>(01) — Intro</p>

    <p class="display col-span-6 text-[clamp(2.25rem,6.4vw,7.5rem)] leading-[0.9] md:col-span-10" data-words>
      Lorem ipsum, I'm <span class="serif-i text-hit">Myles</span>. An art director
      shaping <span class="serif-i">brands</span><sup class="text-hit font-mono text-[0.25em] align-super">①</sup> and
      digital worlds at <span class="serif-i">Elegant&nbsp;Seagulls</span><sup class="text-hit font-mono text-[0.25em] align-super">②</sup>. Dolor
      sit amet, consectetur until it feels inevitable.
    </p>

    <div class="label col-span-6 grid grid-cols-2 gap-6 text-mute md:col-span-4 md:col-start-3 md:grid-cols-2" data-reveal>
      <p><span class="text-hit">①</span> Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, the good idea usually arrives after the safe one.</p>
      <p><span class="text-hit">②</span> Consectetur adipiscing elit, sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p class="label absolute top-1/2 right-[var(--margin)] hidden origin-right translate-x-[0.6em] rotate-90 text-mute md:block">
    v3 was approved. this is v7.
  </p>
</section>
